  "answer_text": "It looks like you're referencing the **Georgia Motor Vehicle Division (MVD) Tag Renewal portal** at **mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx**, which is operated by the **Georgia Department of Revenue (DOR)**. Here's a summary of what that site is used for:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude97 Georgia MVD \u2013 Tag Renewal Portal\n\nGeorgia MVD offers online applications and information regarding **tag renewals, license plates, titles, dealer registrations, and commercial vehicles**.\n\n### \ud83d\udd04 Online Tag (Vehicle Registration) Renewal\nGeorgia residents can **renew their vehicle registration online** at `https://mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx`. However, if the address on your **Renewal Notice is not correct**, you should **not** renew online.\n\nYou must **present your driver's license or Georgia ID** to renew.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udccb Other Ways to Renew\nYou can also renew **by mail** by making a check payable to your county's Tax Commissioner, or **in-person** at your local tag office. When paying in person, accepted payment methods include **MasterCard, Visa, and Discover**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83e\udeaa License Plates\nAfter vehicle registration, you will receive a **license plate with a decal**, which must be **renewed each year**.\n\nGeorgia offers **hundreds of specialty plate designs** to choose from, including veterans, colleges, special interest groups, and more.\n\nA new standard-issue license plate is also available to commemorate the **250th anniversary of the Revolutionary War**, featuring a design created by a Georgia middle school student.\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Tips\n- State of Georgia government websites and email systems use **\"georgia.gov\"** or **\"ga.gov\"** at the end of the address. Before sharing sensitive or personal information, make sure you're on an **official state website**.\n- You can call **1-800-GEORGIA** to verify that a website is an official website of the State of Georgia.\n\n---\n\nWould you like help with a specific task, such as renewing your tag, finding a tag office, or ordering a specialty plate?",
